    <span style="font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:10.5px;line-height:1.6;color:#52525B">16:9 card crop · convergence focal point</span>
  </div></div>
  <div style="padding:28px 30px 30px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;flex:1">
    <div data-row="" style="display:flex;align-items:baseline;justify-content:space-between;gap:14px">
      <h2 data-h3="" style="margin:0;font-family:Sora,sans-serif;font-size:24px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-0.02em">Custom Real Estate CRM</h2>
      <span style="font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:500;font-size:9.5px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8B5CF6;border:1px solid rgba(139,92,246,.35);border-radius:999px;padding:4px 10px;flex:none">In Development</span>
    </div>
    <div style="font-size:12.5px;color:#8B5CF6">CRM &amp; Custom Systems</div>
    <p style="margin:2px 0 0;font-size:14.5px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.7">A system shaped around one brokerage’s real workflow: contacts, properties, opportunities and follow-ups in a single place. In development.</p>
    <div style="font-size:12.5px;color:#52525B;line-height:1.6">Product Strategy · CRM Architecture · Interface Design</div>
    <span style="margin-top:auto;padding-top:16px;font-size:13.5px;color:#8B5CF6;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px">View Case Study <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></span>
  </div>
</a><a href="/work/create-studio" data-route="work-create-studio" data-card="Brand &amp; Digital" aria-label="View the Create Studio case study" style="order:-1;grid-column:1/-1;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:0;border-radius:26px;background:#0E0E12;border:1px solid rgba(139,92,246,.28);overflow:hidden;transition:transform .35s cubic-bezier(.22,.61,.36,1),border-color .35s ease" data-sh="7">
